graph TD;
    %% Core Users & Interfaces
    User((User)) -->|Natural Language| UI[Frontend UI - NestJS]
    UI -->|HTTP POST| Backend[Backend API - FastAPI]

    %% Infrastructure & Tracing
    Backend -.->|Logs Agent Thoughts| TraceNest[(TraceNest Logger)]
    Backend -.->|Caches State| Redis[(Redis Cache)]
    Backend -.->|Saves History| Postgres[(PostgreSQL DB)]

    %% Agent Swarm (The Syndicate)
    subgraph Agent Swarm
        Backend --> IntentPlan[1. Intent & Planning Agent]
        IntentPlan --> ContentGen[2. Content Generation Agent]
        ContentGen --> SecGuard[3. Security Guard]
        SecGuard --> ExecPlanner[4. Execution Planner]
    end

    %% Security Logic
    SecGuard -->|Malicious / Destructive| Block((BLOCKED))
    SecGuard -.->|Downgrades 'Send' to 'Draft'| ExecPlanner

    %% Execution Routing
    ExecPlanner -->|Decision: Web/URL?| WebTask[requires_browser=True]
    ExecPlanner -->|Decision: Local OS?| LocalTask[shell_script=Generated Code]

    WebTask --> DockerBridge{Docker-to-Host Bridge}
    LocalTask --> DockerBridge

    %% Host Execution
    subgraph Native Host Machine
        DockerBridge -->|Port 8003| LocalExecutor[local_executor.py]
        LocalExecutor -->|Web Task| OpenBrowser[Pop Open Browser Native]
        LocalExecutor -->|Local Task| OpenTerminal[CREATE_NEW_CONSOLE popup]
        OpenTerminal --> Validation[psutil Validation: Did it launch?]
        OpenBrowser --> Validation
    end

    Validation -->|Validation Output| UI
